  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SEPA Preparatory Phase Waste Management</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SEPA Preparatory Phase Waste Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

SEPA har ans&#xf6;kt om finansiering p&#xe5; 1,9 miljoner kronor f&#xf6;r att utf&#xf6;ra &quot;f&#xf6;rslaget f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rbereda en l&#xe5;ngsiktig projektplan f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av ett integrerat system f&#xf6;r avfallshantering i Georgien&quot; under perioden 2015.03-2015.11

Insatsen syftar till att f&#xf6;ra samman viktiga intressenter f&#xf6;r att tillsammans enas om v&#xe4;gen fram&#xe5;t mot ett integrerat avfallshanteringssystem i Georgien. Detta syfte kommer att uppn&#xe5;s genom inramande uppdrag i Georgien med m&#xe5;let att etablera en konstruktiv dialog med viktiga samarbetspartners och ber&#xf6;rda akt&#xf6;rer. Naturv&#xe5;rdsverket kommer att genomf&#xf6;ra interventionen tillsammans med experter p&#xe5; avfallshantering. 

Insatsens sammanlagda budget &#xe4;r 1.9 miljoner kronor, s&#xf6;kt fr&#xe5;n Sveriges ambassad i Tbilisi.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SEPA has applied to the Embassy of Sweden for funding of 1.9 million SEK to carry out the &quot; proposal towards preparing a long-term project plan for the implementation of an integrated waste management system in Georgia&quot; during the period 2015.03-2015.11

The intervention aims at bringing key stakeholders together to agree on the way forward towards an integrated waste management system in Georgia. This aim will be achieved by conducting scoping missions to Georgia with a goal to establish a constructive dialogue with the main cooperation partners and relevant stakeholders and workshops will be conducted in this scope. The SEPA will implement the intervention together with experts of waste management. 

The intervention&#x2019;s total budget is 1.9 million SEK requested from the Embassy of Sweden, Tbilisi.</narrative>
  </description>
